<h3>Notes</h3>

<p>
  <strong>Installations:</strong> GitHub installations whose location filter or location preference includes
  leaseweb-wdc02. <strong>US Only</strong> means the location filter is only leaseweb-wdc02, so runners can't be placed
  elsewhere.
</p>

<p><strong>GithubRunnerVCpu Quota:</strong> Effective x64 runner quota. The total counts each project once.</p>

<p>
  <strong>Runner Capacity:</strong> Accepting hosts in leaseweb-wdc02 with an activated github-* boot image.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>Quota vs Fleet:</strong> Total GithubRunnerVCpu quota of US installations compared to the x64 runner capacity.
</p>
